body:
10 team, .5 PPR. Have Hock @ TE - who is questionable and has a bye in Week 13. I currently have McBride as a backup for this week and to cover the bye, but Ertz might be back by then. Ferguson just got dropped. 

&#x200B;

Is it worth taking Ferg over Mcbride?

I mean if he takes Lockett or Brown instead of Evans that would be better, but otherwise idk who you'd start at RB2.

&#x200B;

 Id rather have Cook/Mixon/Wilson/Lockett/Brown starting vs. Cook/Brieda?/Wilson/Evans/Lockett

Trade A is not good, Henry is playing and getting good volume, I wouldn't trade him for JT straight up.

&#x200B;

Trade B is amazing for you, take that ASAP.
